        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>矩阵乘法笔记</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #6b4a2f;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f4f6f2;\n    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(\n      to bottom,\n      transparent 0px,\n      transparent 21px,\n      #cfe0ea 21px,\n      #cfe0ea 22px\n    );\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 55px 30px 40px 55px;\n  }\n  .header-line {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 22px;\n    right: 30px;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    color: #7a8b99;\n    text-align: left;\n    line-height: 20px;\n  }\n  .margin-rule {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    left: 46px;\n    width: 1px;\n    background: #e3b9c4;\n  }\n  .topfaint {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 26px;\n    left: 90px;\n    color: #d9b8d0;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    opacity: 0.6;\n  }\n  .blue { color: #1f4fd8; }\n  .green { color: #17864a; }\n  .red { color: #d0342c; }\n  .purple { color: #7a3fa0; }\n  .teal { color: #1a7f7a; }\n\n  .block { margin-bottom: 6px; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n  .indent1 { margin-left: 18px; }\n  .indent2 { margin-left: 40px; }\n  .indent3 { margin-left: 60px; }\n\n  .note-right {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 22px;\n    top: 205px;\n    width: 175px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #17864a;\n  }\n  .faint-right {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 24px;\n    color: #b9c6cf;\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #9aa;\n    color: #778;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .logo {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 26px;\n    bottom: 18px;\n    color: #1f6fc0;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  .spine-left {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    width: 26px;\n    background: #eceee9;\n    border-right: 1px solid #cbd3d8;\n  }\n  .left-fragments {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 2px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #333;\n    writing-mode: horizontal-tb;\n  }\n  mjx-container { font-size: 95%; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"spine-left\"></div>\n  <div class=\"margin-rule\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"header-line\">No.<br>Date</div>\n  <div class=\"topfaint\">[illegible]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"left-fragments\" style=\"top:150px;\">[illegible]</div>\n  <div class=\"left-fragments\" style=\"top:290px;\">[illegible]</div>\n  <div class=\"left-fragments\" style=\"top:520px;\">[illegible]</div>\n  <div class=\"left-fragments\" style=\"top:560px;\">[illegible]</div>\n\n  <!-- 例：设 A = ... B = ... 求AB -->\n  <div class=\"block row blue\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">\n    <span>例：设 $A=\\begin{pmatrix}1 &amp; 0 &amp; -3 &amp; 0\\\\ -1 &amp; 3 &amp; 0\\\\ 0 &amp; 5 &amp; -1 &amp; 4\\end{pmatrix}$</span>\n    <span>$B=\\begin{pmatrix}0 &amp; 3 &amp; 4\\\\ 1 &amp; 2 &amp; 1\\\\ 1 &amp; 2 &amp; 1\\\\ -1 &amp; 2 &amp; 1\\end{pmatrix}$</span>\n    <span class=\"green\">求AB</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"block row indent2 purple\">\n    <span class=\"blue\">$AB=\\begin{pmatrix}-3 &amp; 6 &amp; 7\\\\ 10 &amp; -2 &amp; -6\\\\ -2 &amp; 17 &amp; 10\\end{pmatrix}$</span>\n    <span style=\"font-size:11px;\">$=\\ 1\\times0+0\\times1+(-1)\\times1+2\\times(-1)$</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 2. 比较 -->\n  <div class=\"block red\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">2、比较</div>\n\n  <div class=\"block row indent1 blue\">\n    <span>行列式：$\\begin{vmatrix}a_{11} &amp; a_{12}\\\\ a_{21} &amp; a_{22}\\end{vmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{vmatrix}b_{11} &amp; b_{12} &amp; b_{13}\\\\ b_{21} &amp; b_{22} &amp; b_{23}\\\\ b_{31} &amp; b_{32} &amp; b_{33}\\end{vmatrix}$</span>\n    <span class=\"purple\">有意义</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"block row indent1 blue\">\n    <span>矩阵：$\\begin{pmatrix}a_{11} &amp; a_{12}\\\\ a_{21} &amp; a_{22}\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}b_{11} &amp; b_{12} &amp; b_{13}\\\\ b_{21} &amp; b_{22} &amp; b_{23}\\\\ b_{31} &amp; b_{32} &amp; b_{33}\\end{pmatrix}$</span>\n    <span class=\"teal\">无意义</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note-right\">\n    △ 只有当第一个矩阵<br>\n    的列数与第二个<br>\n    矩阵的行数一致时，<br>\n    两个矩阵才能相乘\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"block blue\" style=\"margin-top:16px;\">\n    相乘结果矩阵形状：\n    <span class=\"green\">结果矩阵的行数 = 第一个矩阵的行数</span><br>\n    <span class=\"green indent3\" style=\"display:inline-block; margin-left:150px;\">列数 = 第二个矩阵的列数</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"block blue\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">\n    （中间相约，取两头：$A_{5\\times4}\\cdot B_{4\\times3}=C_{5\\times3}$）\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"block row blue\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">\n    <span class=\"indent1\">例：$(1\\ \\ 2\\ \\ 3)\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\ 2\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}=(10)$</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"block row green\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">\n    <span class=\"indent2\">$\\begin{pmatrix}-2 &amp; 4\\\\ 1 &amp; -2\\end{pmatrix}_{2\\times2}\\begin{pmatrix}2 &amp; 4\\\\ -3 &amp; -6\\end{pmatrix}_{2\\times2}=\\begin{pmatrix}-16 &amp; -32\\\\ 8 &amp; 16\\end{pmatrix}_{2\\times2}$</span>\n    <span class=\"blue\" style=\"margin-left:20px;\">$AB\\ne BA$</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"block row green\">\n    <span class=\"indent2\">$\\begin{pmatrix}2 &amp; 4\\\\ -3 &amp; -6\\end{pmatrix}_{2\\times2}\\begin{pmatrix}-2 &amp; 4\\\\ 1 &amp; -2\\end{pmatrix}_{2\\times2}=\\begin{pmatrix}0 &amp; 0\\\\ 0 &amp; 0\\end{pmatrix}_{2\\times2}$</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"block blue\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n    ① 矩阵乘法不一定满足交换律\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"block blue\">\n    ② 矩阵 $A\\ne O$，$B\\ne O$ 却有 $AB=O$\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"block blue indent1\">\n    从而不能由 $AB=O$ 得出 $A=O$ 或 $B=O$ 的结论\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"block blue\">\n    ③ $AB=AC$，$A\\ne O$ $\\not\\Rightarrow$ $B=C$\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 右侧被遮挡的对页残留文字 -->\n  <div class=\"faint-right\" style=\"top:495px;\">[illegible]</div>\n  <div class=\"faint-right\" style=\"top:520px;\">[illegible]</div>\n  <div class=\"faint-right\" style=\"top:545px;\">[illegible]</div>\n  <div class=\"faint-right\" style=\"top:570px;\">[illegible]</div>\n  <div class=\"faint-right\" style=\"top:598px;\">[illegible]</div>\n  <div class=\"faint-right\" style=\"top:625px;\">[illegible]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"logo\">KOKUYO</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
